===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[united|United]] [[kingdom|Kingdom]]|def=1}}

# {{senseid|en|Q145}}A [[kingdom]] and [[sovereign]] [[state]] in [[Western Europe]] comprising the four countries of [[England]], [[Scotland]] and [[Wales]] on the island of [[Great Britain]], and [[Northern Ireland]] on the northeastern portion of the island of [[Ireland]] since 1922.
# {{senseid|en|Q174193}}{{lb|en|historical}} The [[United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland]] (1801–1922).
# {{senseid|en|Q161885}}{{lb|en|historical|informal|nonstandard}} The [[Kingdom of Great Britain]] (1707–1801).
# {{lb|en|nation's name}} A [[kingdom]] [[consisting]] of several [[constituency|constituencies]], either [[actual]], [[historical]], or [[hypothetical]].
#: {{ux|en|the '''United Kingdom''' of Portugal, Brazil and the Algarves}}
#: {{ux|en|the '''United Kingdom''' of Sweden and Norway}}

